athan-app (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Features:
    - Prayer time calculation with multiple methods (ISNA, MWL, etc.)
    - Background daemon for reliable Athan playback
    - GNOME top panel indicator with countdown
    - Audio device selection for Athan output
    - Custom Athan audio file support
    - Per-prayer enable/disable
    - Auto-relaunch capability
    - System sleep/resume handling

 -- Athan App Team <contact@athanapp.com>  Tue, 20 Jan 2026 12:00:00 +0000
